HB0167 Local government reporting.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Bratten, Andrew, Angelos, Hoeft,
Locke, Webb and Webber and Senator(s) Biteman, Boner,
Hutchings and Ide
AN ACT relating to the administration of government; requiring certain reports
and adopted budgets of municipalities, counties, school districts and special
districts to be posted to websites as specified; requiring adopted budgets to
include a report on revenues and expenditures from the preceding fiscal year;
specifying applicability; and providing for an effective date.
